        "label": "May telemetry send about this page",
        "job": "Say whether a telemetry sink may send or keep anything about a page or event, from how private the page that was served is",
        "description": "Give surface (site, public-page, elsewhere, app or service) and path of the served page, optionally declared (the privacy class its handler declared) and sink (page_script, page_events, client_health or server_events). The class is the longest matching route's; a declared class can only make it more private. A surface and path no route names, or a declared class that is not known, is 'unknown', which feeds no sink. Returns class and sinks (the sinks that class may feed); with sink, also sink and may_send. A sink that is not one of the four is refused.",
